<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 3/4.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 3/4.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>3/4. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 3/4	  June 2/3</p>
<p> CZK	0.41718	   0.41742</p>
<p> DKK	2.09984	   2.10086</p>
<p> FIM	2.66412	   2.65382</p>
<p> HUF	0.07491	   0.07484</p>
<p> JPY	0.11909	   0.11813</p>
<p> LTL	3.45515	   3.43634</p>
<p> LVL     24.15734	  24.01538</p>
<p> RUR	0.00239	   0.00238</p>
<p> SEK	1.77349	   1.77165</p>
<p> UAH	7.43843	   7.38662</p>
<p> USD     13.818	    13.7428</p>
<p> XEU     15.61089	  15.57953</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
